      "originalText": "After EKS is deployed, configure kubectl from a machine with VPC access (or via VPN/bastion):\n\n# Update kubeconfig (requires VPC network access)\naws eks update-kubeconfig \\\n  --region ap-southeast-1 \\\n  --name hc-eks-cluster \\\n  --profile pegb",
