      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Let's create service accounts, roles and role bindings that vault will use.\nThis creates in the demo-app namespace:\n\nvault-viewer ServiceAccount + viewer Role\nvault-operator ServiceAccount + operator Role\nvault-admin ServiceAccount + admin Role",
