      "text": "Configure Vault Kubernetes Secrets Engine\n\nPrerequisites\n1. Vault server accessible\n2. ServiceAccount token for Vault to authenticate to Kubernetes\n\n\nCreate Vault Service Account\n# Create a ServiceAccount for Vault in kube-system\nkubectl create serviceaccount vault-auth -n kube-system\n\n# Create ClusterRoleBinding for token creation\nkubectl create clusterrolebinding vault-auth-tokenreview \\\n  --clusterrole=system:auth-delegator \\\n  --serviceaccount=kube-system:vault-auth\n\n# Generate a token for Vault\nkubectl create token vault-auth -n kube-system --duration=8760h > vault-sa-token.txt\n\n\n\n---------- Deploy Vault Configuration ------------\ncd vault/\n\n# Set environment variables\nexport VAULT_ADDR=\"https://your-vault-server:8200\"\nexport VAULT_TOKEN=\"your-vault-token\"\n\n# Create terraform.tfvars\ncat > terraform.tfvars <<EOF\nkubernetes_host     = \"https://XXXXXX.gr7.ap-southeast-1.eks.amazonaws.com\"\nkubernetes_ca_cert  = \"$(terraform -chdir=../terraform output -raw cluster_certificate_authority_data | base64 -d)\"\nvault_sa_jwt_token  = \"$(cat ../vault-sa-token.txt)\"\nkubernetes_namespace = \"demo-app\"\nEOF\n\n# Deploy\nterraform init\nterraform plan\nterraform apply",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Configure Vault Kubernetes Secrets Engine\n\nPrerequisites\n1. Vault server accessible\n2. ServiceAccount token for Vault to authenticate to Kubernetes\n\n\nCreate Vault Service Account\n# Create a ServiceAccount for Vault in kube-system\nkubectl create serviceaccount vault-auth -n kube-system\n\n# Create ClusterRoleBinding for token creation\nkubectl create clusterrolebinding vault-auth-tokenreview \\\n  --clusterrole=system:auth-delegator \\\n  --serviceaccount=kube-system:vault-auth\n\n# Generate a token for Vault\nkubectl create token vault-auth -n kube-system --duration=8760h > vault-sa-token.txt\n\n\n\n---------- Deploy Vault Configuration ------------\ncd vault/\n\n# Set environment variables\nexport VAULT_ADDR=\"https://your-vault-server:8200\"\nexport VAULT_TOKEN=\"your-vault-token\"\n\n# Create terraform.tfvars\ncat > terraform.tfvars <<EOF\nkubernetes_host     = \"https://XXXXXX.gr7.ap-southeast-1.eks.amazonaws.com\"\nkubernetes_ca_cert  = \"$(terraform -chdir=../terraform output -raw cluster_certificate_authority_data | base64 -d)\"\nvault_sa_jwt_token  = \"$(cat ../vault-sa-token.txt)\"\nkubernetes_namespace = \"demo-app\"\nEOF\n\n# Deploy\nterraform init\nterraform plan\nterraform apply",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vG9hhee8rWM19pM9F_QQV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2812.8541753529403,
      "y": 808.7940320426297,
      "width": 855.46875,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "91EDMcQDIFiubfWn4sWUR",
        "JXTR0y3AnAOLJH4o5ShzB"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 863953849,
      "version": 244,
      "versionNonce": 766683097,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788607350452,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Alternative: CLI Method\nIf you prefer CLI over Terraform:\n\n# Enable the Kubernetes secrets engine\nvault secrets enable kubernetes\n\n# Configure the engine\nvault write kubernetes/config \\\n  kubernetes_host=\"https://XXXXXX.gr7.ap-southeast-1.eks.amazonaws.com\" \\\n  kubernetes_ca_cert=@/path/to/ca.crt \\\n  service_account_jwt=@vault-sa-token.txt\n\n# Create roles\nvault write kubernetes/roles/viewer \\\n  allowed_kubernetes_namespaces=\"demo-app\" \\\n  service_account_name=\"vault-viewer\" \\\n  token_default_ttl=\"15m\" \\\n  token_max_ttl=\"1h\"\n\nvault write kubernetes/roles/operator \\\n  allowed_kubernetes_namespaces=\"demo-app\" \\\n  service_account_name=\"vault-operator\" \\\n  token_default_ttl=\"15m\" \\\n  token_max_ttl=\"1h\"\n\nvault write kubernetes/roles/admin \\\n  allowed_kubernetes_namespaces=\"demo-app\" \\\n  service_account_name=\"vault-admin\" \\\n  token_default_ttl=\"15m\" \\\n  token_max_ttl=\"1h\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Alternative: CLI Method\nIf you prefer CLI over Terraform:\n\n# Enable the Kubernetes secrets engine\nvault secrets enable kubernetes\n\n# Configure the engine\nvault write kubernetes/config \\\n  kubernetes_host=\"https://XXXXXX.gr7.ap-southeast-1.eks.amazonaws.com\" \\\n  kubernetes_ca_cert=@/path/to/ca.crt \\\n  service_account_jwt=@vault-sa-token.txt\n\n# Create roles\nvault write kubernetes/roles/viewer \\\n  allowed_kubernetes_namespaces=\"demo-app\" \\\n  service_account_name=\"vault-viewer\" \\\n  token_default_ttl=\"15m\" \\\n  token_max_ttl=\"1h\"\n\nvault write kubernetes/roles/operator \\\n  allowed_kubernetes_namespaces=\"demo-app\" \\\n  service_account_name=\"vault-operator\" \\\n  token_default_ttl=\"15m\" \\\n  token_max_ttl=\"1h\"\n\nvault write kubernetes/roles/admin \\\n  allowed_kubernetes_namespaces=\"demo-app\" \\\n  service_account_name=\"vault-admin\" \\\n  token_default_ttl=\"15m\" \\\n  token_max_ttl=\"1h\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
